1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:01,042
Jaeseong told me

2
00:00:01,042 --> 00:00:02,544
that you are a son
of a shaman.

3
00:00:02,794 --> 00:00:05,296
And that's why you don't let
anyone touch your shoulder.

4
00:00:06,548 --> 00:00:07,548
Stupid, right?

5
00:00:11,136 --> 00:00:12,136
It's true.

6
00:00:13,888 --> 00:00:14,347
What?

7
00:00:14,848 --> 00:00:15,765
No, just kidding.

8
00:00:15,765 --> 00:00:17,726
You scared me!

9
00:00:20,854 --> 00:00:22,605
I'm really afraid of ghosts!

10
00:00:23,815 --> 00:00:25,233
Is that really funny?

11
00:00:26,526 --> 00:00:27,526
Oh.

12
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:30,196
I won't get possessed
even if I touch

13
00:00:30,488 --> 00:00:31,531
your shoulders, right?

14
00:00:31,614 --> 00:00:33,825
Of course, what are you
even talking about?

15
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,080
You went through a lot.

16
00:00:40,915 --> 00:00:42,709
Throwing all by yourself
must've been hard.

17
00:00:46,921 --> 00:00:47,921
What about you?

18
00:00:48,339 --> 00:00:50,019
I know it's tough to catch
all those balls.

19
00:00:53,636 --> 00:00:54,636
Hey, I'm not like you!

20
00:00:55,346 --> 00:00:57,599
I say it right away
whenever it hurts!
